{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Amias was a powerful dragon known for his ability to enucleate, or remove, the cores of ancient crystals. These crystals held the secrets of the land and its forgotten magic. With his keen sense of smell and piercing gaze, Amias could locate the hidden crystals deep within the earth. As he breathed his fiery breath upon them, the crystals would shatter, releasing their essence into the air. The ancient magic would then be absorbed by Amias, allowing him to wield unimaginable power. The people of Aethoria revered Amias as a guardian of the land's secrets, and his ability to enucleate the crystals was seen as a sacred gift. His legend grew, and his name became synonymous with wisdom and ancient knowledge.",
